      "name": "Credit row with poster",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "poster",
      "description": "Three-column row with a 28x42 poster, hairline ring and Still fill.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-rows\"><li><span class=\"ds-poster\"></span><span class=\"ds-title\">Avatar: The Last Airbender</span><span class=\"ds-meta\">8 ep · 2024</span></li></ul>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:#fff;--fg:#111;--text:#3b3b3b;--muted:#6b6b6b;--line:#ebebeb;--underline:#c4c4c4;--still:#f2f2f2;}.ds-rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;width:580px;max-width:100%;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px}.ds-rows li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;column-gap:16px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.ds-poster{display:block;width:28px;height:42px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--still);outline:1px solid var(--line);outline-offset:-1px}.ds-title{color:var(--fg)}.ds-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reel still with Play pill",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "reel-still",
      "description": "16:9 still, 6px radius inside its node, inset hairline ring, solid white Play pill bottom-left.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-reel\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-play\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5.5v13l10.5-6.5z\"/></svg>Play <span class=\"ds-len\">4:37</span></span></a>",
      "css": ":host{--bg:#fff;--fg:#111;--text:#3b3b3b;--muted:#6b6b6b;--line:#ebebeb;--underline:#c4c4c4;--still:#f2f2f2;}.ds-reel{position:relative;display:block;width:420px;max-width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--still);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);transition:box-shadow 200ms ease-out;font-family:Geist,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-reel:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--underline)}.ds-reel:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:3px}.ds-play{position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 14px 6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgb(0 0 0/.66);color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;transition:background-color 200ms ease-out}.ds-reel:hover .ds-play{background:rgb(0 0 0/.86)}.ds-len{color:rgb(255 255 255/.72);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
